{"appId":"com.mmedia.videomerger","gl":"US","fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T11:04:59.320Z","title":"Video Merger - Splice/Collage","summary":"Quickly merge videos, support sequence, up-down, left-right, mirror, PIP modes.","description":"Do you want to Merge/Join/Splice/Collage your favorite videos together into a single video and make it even more appealing？\n\nVideo Merger/Video Collage Maker can help you merge or collage multiple videos into one quickly and with high quality. It supports almost any format of videos as input. Some supported input formats are mp4, mkv, 3gp, 3gpp, mov, flv, avi, mpg, mpeg, m4v, mpeg, vob, wmv, webm etc.\n\nYou can merge videos by Sequence Mode, Side-by-Side Mode, Up-and-Down Mode, Mirror Mode and Picture-in-Picture Mode.\n\nThis app can also help you to make mirror videos conveniently.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSequence Mode\nSupport merging or splicing multiple videos into one video in chronological order.\n\nPicture-in-Picture Mode\nSupport merging two videos into the same video in picture-in-picture format.\n\nSide-by-Side Mode\nSupport merging two videos into one video in horizontal arrangement.\n\nUp-and-Down Mode\nSupport merging two videos into one video in vertical arrangement.\n\nVideo Mirrors\nIt is convenient to make a video into an interesting mirror video.\n\nAll free and without watermark.\n\nRequired Permissions:\nRead or Write External Storage - The permission is required to read and edit video files in the SD Card.","installsLabel":"1,000,000+","minInstalls":1000000,"realInstalls":1012802,"score":4.67,"ratings":7541,"reviews":88,"developer":"MMedia Tech","developerSite":"https://mmedia-tech.web.app/","privacyPolicy":"https://mmedia-tech.web.app/privacy_policy.html","genre":"Tools","released":"Oct 7, 2022","updated":"2026-08-21","containsAds":true,"iap":"$0.99 - $6.99 per item","contentRating":"Everyone","version":"1.2.14","recentChanges":"Bug fixes and performance improvements.","icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8YDejEBSt